WEBVTT - THREAD Story I: Part 1 Subtitles

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
At Aulis, the winds died. A thousand ships lay motionless upon a stagnant sea.

00:11.000 --> 00:18.000
The army rotted in the sun. Agamemnon watched from the high prow of his flagship.

00:21.000 --> 00:28.000
Iphigenia walked toward the granite altar, her white linen robe trailing across dust.

00:31.000 --> 00:38.000
Her eyes held no fear—only the weight of a decree born before her birth.

00:41.000 --> 00:48.000
A king who traded his daughter for a breeze to Troy.

00:51.000 --> 00:58.000
The altar fire flickered against stone carved with forgotten runes.

01:01.000 --> 01:08.000
She reached out to touch the gold inlay.

01:11.000 --> 01:18.000
[TEMPORAL MATCH CUT] Three thousand years later...

01:21.000 --> 01:28.000
Kaelen's hand touched the glowing cyan conduit of Aulis-9.

01:31.000 --> 01:38.000
An orbital core waiting for an identical sacrifice.

01:41.000 --> 01:48.000
The thread connects what time separates.

01:51.000 --> 01:58.000
The wind begins to rise.
